    "text": "WLUC\nwebsite\nHancock\nHancock theater given new name, dedicated to beloved community member\nBy Colin Jackson,\n8 hours agoHANCOCK, Mich. (WLUC) - A community theater in Hancock now has a new name, chosen in memory of a beloved community member. The theater inside the Hancock Community Hub is now the Rachel Marie Blau Memorial Theater. The name was unveiled during Wednesday evening’s 10th anniversary celebration of Right Start UP, the owners of the hub.",
